        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Description:\r\n\r\nN91D959, is a spacious detached single storey residence extending to c.79 sq.m. with attached garage suitable for conversion. The residence also has a good range of outbuildings and surrounded by c.5 acres of excellent quality agricultural land. The property has the benefit of good road frontage to two roads. This lovely family home has commanding views over the surrounding countryside and is only 2km from Ballynacargy village. \r\nBallynacargy is a small village with a great sense of community and only a short drive from Mullingar & Longford. There are excellent amenities and facilities. The Royal canal and Greenway is a fantastic amenity and a lovely place to relax and unwind. \r\nViewing Details:\r\n\r\nFor more information or to arrange a viewing contact Dillon Murtagh, Tel: 044 934 2512\r\n\r\nViewing Highly Recommended"
      },
